      "description": "I see that the inner fire has dwindled. Would you say the spiritual euphoria lasted an hour?\n\nIf it's more of the gizzard gum you desire, then more of the gizzards I require. Back to the wastelands, {name}. Do not return until you have recovered ten gizzards and two jowls.",
